                    <item name="Size" type_name="gh_single" type_code="5">25</item>
                    <item name="Text" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">EDDY COVID-19:

Restaurant Validation Experiment:

Reference: 
https://www.medrxiv.org/content/10.1101/2020.04.16.20067728v1.full.pdf
https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC7323555/

Ventilation Rates used:
- high ventilation 
flow rate = 212  ft^2/min  (1.08m/s)
- low ventilation 
flow rate = 15  ft^2/min (0.08m/s)

Emitter:
 -located at  (1 m, 0.5 m,
1.6 m) 
- injection direction of (0, 1, 0)
- average emission flow 0.21m/s
- size tracer gas pipe= 8-mm inner diameter 
- speed =1.5 m/s
 
-temperature =32–34 °C

-Five coil AC unit: from Daiking website:
https://www.daikinkuwait.com/content/dam/document-library/
catalogues/as/fan-coil-units/fwd-at/FWV_FWL_FWM_FWD_
FWB_EPCE04-25B_Catalogues_English.pdf

Measured Air flow:
non-ABC zone = 1.04 L/s per patron
ABC zone =  0.75 L/s per patron

</item>
